    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glusiverse is a cute'm up in a graphical style like 8 bits machines from 1983, with 8 stages, cute characters, big bosses and a lot of surprises. The scroll is horizontal, but the main character can go right and left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will begin by starting your own journey to save the master. Then it will fly throughout the Glusiverse. Fly through screens of dangerous worlds, trying to find the remedy for your master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long time ago, far away, there existed in space a GLUSIVERSE, where a brave hero called GLUSI-GLUSI fought against his enemies (or not). In space year 6126 the interplanetary Economic System suffered a collapse that caused panic on all planets. At the proposal of the SPACE GUILD someone is guiding the forces of PLANET AMALFAR to build a great fortress in the GLUSIVERSE, where\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 Our protagonist, GLUSI GLUSI, must find the antidote for the disease that threatens the life of his teacher, GLUSEI. To do this, he enters the confines of the GLUSIVERSE in search of the 7 ingredients and the recipe. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 bits graphic style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive, Exciting Game Play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for the Entire Family</p></li></ul>",
